  "description": "The long-awaited second installment in the Court of Darkness series is finally here!\nExperience brand-new romance storylines with a fresh cast of consorts♪\n\n■Story\nThe night of a crimson crescent moon,\nyou find yourself transported\nto a realm called Saligia.\n\nFar removed from your everyday life,\nyou're in a world where magic is commonplace.\n\nIn the midst of your confusion,\nbefore you appear \nfive beautiful princes.\n\nThey crave the power \nyour kiss can bestow, \nand will scheme to get it.\n\nBut what they seek \nis not just your power.\nThey want your heart as well...\n\n■Characters\nRio Voleri　The Affable Optimist\nLance Ira　The Lone Flame\nDia Akedia　The Melancholy Songbird\nLou　The Inscrutable Headmaster\nAquia Avari　The Climent Prince\n\n■Contents\nPrinces’ Path Books 1 & 2 (excluding Special Tales), plus Book 1 Consorts’ Paths for Rio, Lance, Dia, Lou, and Aquia from the romance app Court of Darkness.\n*Does not contain voice or avatar features.",
